<p>Hi there, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chiphop" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6792820); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6792820&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1598980143" alt="ChipHop" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6792820)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chiphop" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6792820); return false;">ChipHop</a></span>! I'm an author on this site as well as a member of Community Outreach. It is good to see you are already acquainted with my friend Quest and the IRC chat. We are glad to have you here. Allow me to make a <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-3034">recommendation</a> to you. The following are several tips with resources for writing and reading here on the wiki!</p>
