<p>Hello. I'm Agent Z. Schaefer. I only recently discovered the SCP FOundation but I must say I was really inspired by the work and imagination that have gone into it. I've been checking out the site for a few weeks as well as many videos about SCPs on Youtube. Because of all this, I was inspired to try creating and writing some of my own and to truly test out my creativity. I am really looking forward to sharing my ideas with such a welcoming group and look forward to hearing your feedback.</p>
<p>As for the question, it would depend on it responds to being around me. For something like SCP 682 or 173, they would have to either not attack me, or defend me in an emergency. But, an SCP like 999 or 500, I would keep no questions asked. Currently, my favorite SCP is 029 for the mystery behind her creation and actions. I would like a miniature version of that to be able to protect me without leaving a mess in my home.</p>
<p>So, time to get down to business.</p>

