<p>Hello! My name is Misha Kastrilevich! I have heard of this website, but I didn't start reading a lot on this website until July. I joined at the beginning of August! I'm an avid writer! I've been writing since middle school, and I am going to the School of Visual Arts in New York to become a screenwriter! I already pitched three ideas in the Ideas Critique chat, one of which just got a full greenlight last night! I have a whole list of SCP ideas that I want to write (it's about four pages), and I get more ideas every day!</p>
<p>I like all kinds of stuff. I am a giant nerd, so I enjoy all forms of media (Video games, movies, comics, cartoons, etc.), but for genres, I like Fantasy, Sci-Fi, Comedy, Historical pieces, Satire, and Horror (from a distance). I'm am also Non-binary, so I prefer They/them pronouns!</p>
<p>As for the question, my personal favorite is SCP-3998 (The Wicker Witch Lives). I would like to have a mini version of it on my desk. Maybe it will randomly set fire to anyone near it. I won't know about it.</p>
<p>Let's get to writing!</p>

