<p>Good day,</p>
<p>You can call me Rhino if you like (it's my username on fandom.wikia as well). I'm excited to be here - really really like reading and writing scifi/fantasy short stories. Some SCP animation videos popped up in Youtube's recommended (specifically the 'Doorman' SCP), and my curiosity peaked after watching it.</p>
<p>I really like the idea of this site! Very fun to read through the SCP pages here. I do have a few ideas of my own I'd like to share if that's okay.</p>
<p>Quick question; if I can't get to the 'Ideas Critique forum' (because I have a chromebook, and some parts of this site will log me out + won't log back in), is there a way to fix that, or perhaps a different place I can post ideas to get them greenlighted?</p>
<p>As for the question, hmm&#8230; my favourite is SCP-323. As to having a miniature version in my house, probably not. I don't really relish the thought of going crazy and banging my head against the wall in order to fit it into SCP-323 (because if it's miniature, it's definitely impossible for me to put it on).</p>
<p>Well, nice to meet you!</p>

